== <script> ==
0000    2 OP_GET_GLOBAL       0 '@println'
0002    | OP_CLOSURE          1 <fn lambda0x1>
0004    | OP_CALL             0
0006    | OP_CALL             1
0008    | OP_POP
0009    3 OP_NIL
0010    | OP_RETURN
== lambda0x1 ==
0000    2 OP_CONSTANT         0 '1'
0002    | OP_CONSTANT         0 '1'
0004    | OP_ADD
0005    | OP_RETURN
